# =============================================================================
# 41-maktab portali — Muhit o'zgaruvchilari
# =============================================================================
# Ushbu faylni .env nomi bilan nusxalang va kerakli qiymatlarni to'ldiring.
# cp .env.example .env

# ── Supabase ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="your-publishable-key"
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="your-project-id"

# ── Google OAuth (Supabase Dashboard da sozlash kerak) ──────────────────────
# Google OAuth quyidagi holatda ishlaydi:
#
# 1. Lovable platformasida: Lovable auth avtomatik Google OAuth ni boshqaradi.
#    Qo'shimcha sozlash shart emas.
#
# 2. Lokal rivojlantirish yoki boshqa hostingda:
#    a) Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com) da loyiha yarating
#    b) "APIs & Services" > "Credentials" bo'limida OAuth 2.0 Client ID yarating
#    c) Authorized redirect URIs ga quyidagilarni qo'shing:
#       - https://your-project.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#       - http://localhost:5173/auth (lokal dev uchun)
#    d) Supabase Dashboard > Authentication > Providers > Google bo'limida
#       Google Client ID va Client Secret ni kiriting
#    e) Supabase redirect URL sifatida quyidagini qo'shing:
#       **\{\{ SITE_URL \}\}/auth**
#
# 3. Google Cloud Console dagi "OAuth consent screen" da:
#    - User Type: External (yoki internal)
#    - Scopes: email, profile, openid
#    - Test users: o'zingizning emailingizni qo'shing (publish qilmaguningizcha)

# ── Lovable (avtomatik yaratiladi) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# LOVABLE_PROJECT_ID=""    # Lovable avtomatik sozlaydi
